title: "V11 RADIA Radiation Studio"
version: 9.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-22
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "V11 RADIA Radiation Studio contributors"
abstract: >-
  A research-oriented Python and Streamlit workflow connecting RADIA-based
  insertion-device magnetic-field models to relativistic single-electron
  trajectory integration and Lienard-Wiechert radiation analysis.
keywords:
